    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Improved Counterspell</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use an area dispel with Improved Counterspell or Greater Counterspell, you may choose to only dispel effects from a single magic sphere or school of magic. If you do, the radius of the area dispel is doubled.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting 2: Counters and Control</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/counterspell-feats#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
